    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 68 Jolly Mariner is a beautifully maintained first floor apartment situated in the highly sought after Coosan area of Athlone. Offering stylish, comfortable accommodation together with exceptional waterfront views, this impressive property is presented in excellent condition. The apartment features a bright and welcoming entrance hall with elegant oak flooring and useful storage. At the heart of the property is a spacious open plan kitchen, dining and living area, finished with oak flooring and tasteful dcor. A striking floor to ceiling window floods the room with natural light while taking full advantage of the superb views over the marina and River Shannon. The living area opens onto a large private balcony, providing the perfect outdoor space to relax, unwind and enjoy the peaceful waterside setting.\nThe well appointed kitchen offers ample fitted storage at both eye and base level and is equipped with integrated appliances including a fridge freezer and dishwasher. A separate utility room provides additional practical storage and convenience. There are two generous double bedrooms, both benefiting from beautiful River Shannon views. The master bedroom includes a stylish ensuite, while the main bathroom is finished to a high standard and features a bath with overhead shower, WC and wash hand basin. Presented in excellent condition throughout, No. 68 Jolly Mariner offers a rare opportunity to rent a high quality home in one of Athlone's most desirable waterfront locations.\nKey features include:\nTwo spacious double bedrooms\nMaster bedroom with ensuite\nBright open-plan kitchen/living/dining area\nExceptional marina and River Shannon views\nLarge private balcony\nSeparate utility room\nHigh-quality finishes throughout\nExcellent condition\nFurnished\nHighly sought-after Coosan location\nConvenient access to Athlone town and local amenities\n\n \n\nOutside\nThe outdoor space at No. 68 is a real highlight, offering a seamless extension of the apartment's living area. The spacious private balcony enjoys sweeping views over the marina and the River Shannon, providing the perfect setting for morning coffee or evening relaxation while taking in the ever-changing waterside scenery. The apartment also benefits from ample car parking for residents and visitors alike. To the front, it overlooks a large, well maintained green area which gently leads down to the marina, enhancing the sense of space and tranquillity and adding to the overall appeal of this exceptional waterside home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom first floor apartment\nStunning views over the marina and the River Shannon\nBright and spacious open-plan kitchen/living/dining area\nFloor to ceiling window maximising natural light and views\nLarge private balcony overlooking the water\nTwo generous double bedrooms\nMaster bedroom with stylish ensuite\nTastefully finished main bathroom with bath and shower\nFully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\nSeparate utility room for added convenience\nOak flooring throughout main living areas\nAmple resident and visitor car parking\nOverlooking a large green area leading to the marina\nLocated in a highly sought after residential area in Coosan\n\nNo. 68 Jolly Mariner is a beautifully presented first-floor apartment offering superb turnkey condition and breathtaking waterfront views. Overlooking the marina and the River Shannon, this stylish home is filled with natural light and thoughtfully laid out to maximise both comfort and scenery. The spacious open plan living area features a striking floor to ceiling window and direct access to a large private balcony, perfect for enjoying the peaceful surroundings. With two generous double bedrooms, including a master ensuite, a modern fitted kitchen, and a separate utility room, this apartment offers both practicality and elegance. Positioned adjacent to a large green area leading to the marina and with ample parking available.\n \n Mains Water\nMains Drainage\nMains Gas \n The Jolly Mariner development in Coosan enjoys a highly convenient and well established residential setting, just minutes from the heart of Athlone town. A wide range of amenities are within easy reach, including shops, cafes, and everyday services at Arcadia Retail Park, while Athlone town centre offers an excellent selection of retail, dining, and leisure options all within a short drive or pleasant walk . Locally, residents can enjoy popular spots such as Lough Ree Inn, a scenic lakeside bar and restaurant at Coosan Point, and Coosan Tavern, a well known local hub. The area is also close to excellent schools, sporting facilities, and riverside walks, with the marina and shoreline just on your doorstep, offering a superb lifestyle balance of convenience and natural beauty."
      },
